<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Mathematical Proof</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma 3.1 (HJB for Multi-agent Systems). ‣ 3.2.1 Critic Learning with HJB. ‣ 3.2 HJB and Policy Learning ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ Continuous-Time Value Iteration for Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Given all <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x,t)\in\mathcal{X}\times[0,T]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x,t)\in\mathcal{X}\times[0,T]</annotation></semantics></math> and a small horizon <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta t&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta t&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, we apply a Taylor expansion to the definition of <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V(x,t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V(x,t)</annotation></semantics></math> in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E2" title="In Definition 1 (Value Function of Multi-agent Systems). ‣ 3.1 Problem Formulation ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ Continuous-Time Value Iteration for Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>) to derive the HJB PDE as follows:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex1X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex1X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle V(x,t)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle V(x,t)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex1X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t}^{T}e^{-\rho(\tau-t)}r(x,u)d\tau+g(x_{T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mmultiscripts><mo>∫</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi></mrow><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts></mstyle><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t}^{T}e^{-\rho(\tau-t)}r(x,u)d\tau+g(x_{T})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex1Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex1Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t}^{t+\Delta t}e^{-\rho(\tau-t)}r(x(\tau),u(\tau))d\tau+\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t+\Delta t}^{T}e^{-\rho(\tau-t)}r(x(\tau),u(\tau))d\tau+g(x_{T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mmultiscripts><mo>∫</mo><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi></mrow><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts></mstyle><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mmultiscripts><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi></mrow><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts></mstyle><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t}^{t+\Delta t}e^{-\rho(\tau-t)}r(x(\tau),u(\tau))d\tau+\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t+\Delta t}^{T}e^{-\rho(\tau-t)}r(x(\tau),u(\tau))d\tau+g(x_{T})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex1Xb"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex1Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t}^{t+\Delta t}e^{-\rho(\tau-t)}r(x(\tau),u(\tau))d\tau+\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t}^{T-\Delta t}e^{-\rho(s+\Delta t-t)}r(x(s+\Delta t),u(s+\Delta t))ds+g(x_{T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mmultiscripts><mo>∫</mo><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi></mrow><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts></mstyle><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mmultiscripts><mo>∫</mo><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi></mrow><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts></mstyle><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t}^{t+\Delta t}e^{-\rho(\tau-t)}r(x(\tau),u(\tau))d\tau+\max_{u\in\mathcal{U}}\int_{t}^{T-\Delta t}e^{-\rho(s+\Delta t-t)}r(x(s+\Delta t),u(s+\Delta t))ds+g(x_{T})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex1Xc"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
